Association StudentDisciplineIncidentAssociation [607]
    deprecated "Users of this element are advised to use StudentDisciplineIncidentBehaviorAssociation or StudentDisciplineIncidentNon-Offender association instead. Expect removal of this element in a future release."
    documentation "This association indicates those students who were victims, perpetrators, witnesses, and reporters for a discipline incident."
    domain entity Student [1072]
        documentation "Relates the student associated with the discipline incident."
    domain entity DisciplineIncident [1070]
        documentation "Reference to the discipline incident associated with the student."
    descriptor StudentParticipationCode [1071]
        documentation "The role or type of participation of a student in a discipline incident."
        is required
    common Behavior [1069]
        documentation "Describes behavior by category and provides a detailed description."
        is optional collection
